                                "sense_id": "cac35d4e-1b7f-3dc0-9b43-e0e5b0d4cb49",
                                "text": "5 Merging of Adlets\nAdlets move from sites to sites to seek out new adlets or active documents, announce its own presence and collect information. In its movement adlets behave like magnets. An adlet or a collection of adlets can attract other ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "357e7c4a-dd6a-4eb4-85ae-9d14f4f0992a",
                                "sense_id": "cac35d4e-1b7f-3dc0-9b43-e0e5b0d4cb49",
                                "text": "In our example, an adlet is created to perform the airline reservation. Such an adlet is equipped with the capability to interact with the airline reservation system and issue transactions to obtain available flights, seats and prices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d068934c-d130-4cc0-bddb-6cb1cb0e6f68",
                                "sense_id": "cac35d4e-1b7f-3dc0-9b43-e0e5b0d4cb49",
                                "text": "The specific mobile agents of interest are called adlets, which are mobile agents carrying the metadata of various kinds of multimedia documents. Adlets autonomously travel from site to site on the Internet, advertising its contents and ..."
                            }
                        ]
